 available to complete the Overstock task.Stocking Task: Fixed an issue where immediatel","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-24T03:59:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114038668","verified_at":"2026-10-24T05:25:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4309310-1847286114031237","game_id":"steam-4309310","kind":"update","title":"VOIDSHIFT Demo – v1.0.4 Hotfix","summary":"Update v1.0.4 for the VOIDSHIFT demo is now live! This hotfix addresses two issues involving Envy's spawning behavior and the interaction prompt for Eden.Bug FixesEnvy Spawning & Collision: Fixed an issue where Envy could appear out of thin air and interfere with the player's collision.Talk to Eden Prompt: Fixed an issue where the \"Talk to Eden\" interaction prompt could appear even when the player wasn't looking at Eden.Thank You!Thank you to everyone who continues to play the VOIDSHIFT demo and","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T05:09:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114031237","verified_at":"2026-10-22T09:48:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4309310-1847286114029993","game_id":"steam-4309310","kind":"update","title":"VOIDSHIFT Demo – v1.0.3 Patch Notes","summary":"Update v1.0.3 for the VOIDSHIFT demo is now live! This update focuses on improving controller support, addressing minor visual issues, and making the in-game bug reporting system more accessible.Controller ImprovementsController Navigation: Fixed several issues with controller navigation throughout the game's interface.Bug Report Keyboard: Added an on-screen keyboard to the bug report window, allowing controller users to enter and submit bug reports without needing a physical keyboard.Visual Fix","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T18:50:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114029993","verified_at":"2026-10-21T22:46:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4309310-1847286114027157","game_id":"steam-4309310","kind":"update","title":"VOIDSHIFT Demo – v1.0.2 Patch Notes","summary":"Update v1.0.2 for the VOIDSHIFT demo is now available! This update brings several gameplay improvements, visual fixes, and quality-of-life adjustments to improve the overall experience.Gameplay ImprovementsStocking Tasks: Increased the interaction range for stocking tasks. Previously, players had to stand near the center of an aisle to stock shelves. You can now complete these tasks from a wider area within the aisle.Controller Sensitivity: Increased the maximum controller stick sensitivity from","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T00:47:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114027157","verified_at":"2026-10-21T04:21:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4309310-1846651706693649","game_id":"steam-4309310","kind":"update","title":"VOIDSHIFT Demo – v1.0.1 Hotfix","summary":"Bug FixesEmployee Summary: Fixed an issue where your Steam username would not appear on the Employee Summary screen after completing a night.HUD Visibility: Fixed an issue where the HUD could occasionally reappear after a dialogue box or task disappeared, even when the HUD was disabled in Settings.Startup Crash: Fixed an issue that could occasionally cause the game to crash when loading into gameplay for the first time.Wrath AI: Fixed an issue where Wrath could occasionally run in place immediat","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T04:18:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706693649","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:42:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4309310-1846018067927858","game_id":"steam-4309310","kind":"announcement","title":"VOIDSHIFT is Officially Coming to Steam Next Fest!","summary":"VOIDSHIFT is Officially Coming to Steam Next Fest!Back in July, we announced that VOIDSHIFT had been submitted for Steam Next Fest.Now, we're excited to make it official:VOIDSHIFT will be participating in Steam Next Fest.After months of development, testing, optimization, bug fixes, and polish, we're getting ready to finally put the VOIDSHIFT Demo into your hands.The demo will officially release on:October 19, 2026 — 12:00 PM Eastern TimeOne hour before Steam Next Fest begins.The demo will allow","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T00:05:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067927858","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:42:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4309310-1836506165566292","game_id":"steam-4309310","kind":"announcement","title":"VOIDSHIFT Has Been Submitted for Steam Next Fest!","summary":"VOIDSHIFT Has Been Submitted for Steam Next Fest!Hello everyone!First of all, thank you to everyone who has wishlisted VOIDSHIFT so far. Every wishlist, follow, comment, and bit of support truly means a lot to us. Seeing people excited about the game motivates our team every day, and we're incredibly grateful for the support the community has shown since the Steam page went live.We're excited to share that VOIDSHIFT has officially been submitted for Steam Next Fest, and we're now focused on prep","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-01T19:47:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_comm